      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">FIVE NIGHTS, ONE DIALOGUE</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">A philosopher. A youth. A book that changed minds.</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"180\" width=\"430\" height=\"320\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"315\" y=\"240\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">THE PHILOSOPHER</text><text x=\"315\" y=\"290\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Calm. Patient.</text><text x=\"315\" y=\"330\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Teaches Adlerian psychology</text><text x=\"315\" y=\"380\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">\"The world is simple.\"</text><text x=\"315\" y=\"420\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">\"People can change.\"</text><text x=\"315\" y=\"460\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">\"You can be happy now.\"</text><rect x=\"570\" y=\"180\" width=\"430\" height=\"320\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.12)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"785\" y=\"240\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">THE YOUTH</text><text x=\"785\" y=\"290\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Angry. Wounded.</text><text x=\"785\" y=\"330\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Defends the \"common sense\"</text><text x=\"785\" y=\"380\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">\"The world is complicated.\"</text><text x=\"785\" y=\"420\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">\"People cannot change.\"</text><text x=\"785\" y=\"460\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">\"My past determines me.\"</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"560\" width=\"800\" height=\"220\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"615\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">THE CENTRAL QUESTION</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"670\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Are you who you are BECAUSE of your past...</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"710\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">or because of a goal you're holding NOW?</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"755\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">Adler answers: the latter. Always the latter.</text><rect x=\"200\" y=\"830\" width=\"700\" height=\"120\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.12)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"885\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">Sold 3.5 million copies in Japan</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"920\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Translated into 30+ languages. A global phenomenon.</text></svg>",
      "caption": "The Socratic frame of the book"
