      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">THE CASE OF THE CLOSED ROOM</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">Same young man. Two opposite diagnoses.</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"180\" width=\"940\" height=\"100\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"220\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">THE FACT</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">A young man cannot leave his room. Panic when he tries.</text><rect x=\"60\" y=\"320\" width=\"480\" height=\"320\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.12)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"375\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">FREUD'S ANSWER</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"425\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Trauma caused the anxiety</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"460\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Anxiety caused the closure</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"510\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">\"Until trauma is processed,</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"540\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">the door cannot open.\"</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-size=\"20\">Hope lives in the past.</text><rect x=\"560\" y=\"320\" width=\"480\" height=\"320\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"800\" y=\"375\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">ADLER'S ANSWER</text><text x=\"800\" y=\"425\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">A goal: stay in the room</text><text x=\"800\" y=\"460\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Anxiety is PRODUCED to fit</text><text x=\"800\" y=\"510\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">\"Inside, he is special.</text><text x=\"800\" y=\"540\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Outside, he is ordinary.\"</text><text x=\"800\" y=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-size=\"20\">Hope lives in the goal.</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"680\" width=\"900\" height=\"160\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.12)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"735\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">WHY THIS MATTERS</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"780\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">If the past caused it → nothing can be done</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"815\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">If a goal produced it → a new goal dissolves it</text><rect x=\"200\" y=\"870\" width=\"700\" height=\"100\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.12)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"920\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">\"Hikikomori\" — 1M+ people in Japan</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"955\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">A real cultural phenomenon, not a thought experiment</text></svg>",
      "caption": "Same room, two psychologies"
