     "explanation": "Teleology (telos = goal) reads behavior forward, not backward: the question is not 'what caused this?' but 'what is this for?' Option A is the etiological / Freudian view Adler explicitly rejects. Option C is also Freud. Option D overstates: Adler doesn't say the past is irrelevant — he says it does not *determine* you. We give meaning to our experiences; the meaning we give serves our current goals.",
