      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">KNOWLEDGE CHECK</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">Teleology — the engine of Adlerian psychology</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"200\" width=\"800\" height=\"220\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"260\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">THE TEST QUESTION</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"320\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Not \"Why is this happening to me?\"</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"360\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">But \"What is this currently FOR?\"</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"400\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">Forward, not backward.</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"460\" width=\"800\" height=\"200\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"520\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">TELEOLOGY IN ONE LINE</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"575\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Behavior is best explained by</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"615\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">the goal it serves NOW.</text><rect x=\"200\" y=\"700\" width=\"700\" height=\"180\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"755\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">WATCH THE TRAP</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"800\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Adler doesn't say the past is irrelevant.</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"840\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">He says it does not DETERMINE you.</text></svg>",
