      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">DIAGNOSE YOUR WEAKEST PILLAR</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">Rate. Note. Cause. Act. Re-rate.</text><rect x=\"60\" y=\"180\" width=\"320\" height=\"240\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"220\" y=\"240\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">SELF-ACCEPTANCE</text><text x=\"220\" y=\"290\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">No-flinch test</text><text x=\"220\" y=\"335\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Rate yourself</text><text x=\"220\" y=\"370\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">1 — 10</text><rect x=\"390\" y=\"180\" width=\"320\" height=\"240\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.12)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"240\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">TRUST</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"290\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Default-openness test</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"335\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Rate yourself</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"370\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">1 — 10</text><rect x=\"720\" y=\"180\" width=\"320\" height=\"240\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"880\" y=\"240\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">CONTRIBUTION</text><text x=\"880\" y=\"290\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Un-audienced acts</text><text x=\"880\" y=\"335\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Rate yourself</text><text x=\"880\" y=\"370\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">1 — 10</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"450\" width=\"940\" height=\"160\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.12)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"505\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">LOWEST = WEAKEST = NEXT</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"555\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">A 9 elsewhere does not compensate for a 3 here.</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"590\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">The architecture is only as steady as the weakest leg.</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"630\" width=\"940\" height=\"160\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.12)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"685\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">WHY IS IT LOW? (Teleological)</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"735\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">What goal are you serving by keeping it low?</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"770\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">\"Low trust serves: avoiding being wrong.\"</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"810\" width=\"940\" height=\"160\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"865\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">ONE ACT THAT MOVES 3 → 4</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"915\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Not transformation. Direction.</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"950\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">Re-rate at month's end.</text></svg>",
      "caption": "Find the weak leg. Strengthen it."
